---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import ProjectIcon from '../components/ProjectIcon.astro';
---
<Layout title="Social Media" description="Digital channels, content campaigns, and brand communities managed and grown across higher-education operations.">
  <Breadcrumb crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Social Media' }]} />
  
  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
        <ProjectIcon name="social" size="sm" />
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Social Media &amp; Digital PR</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Institutional channels, content campaigns, and digital brand communities managed from inception to audience scale.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
    <!-- Channel 1: @io.uny -->
    <section class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-200 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-[#2e2e33]" aria-labelledby="channel-io-uny">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
          <div class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-1.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-neutral-300 dark:bg-white">
            <img src="/logos/io-kotak.png" alt="IO UNY Logo" class="h-full w-full object-contain" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-950/60 dark:text-blue-300">
                Institutional Instagram
              </span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400">·</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">2021 – present (5+ years)</span>
            </div>
            <h2 id="channel-io-uny" class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
              @io.uny — UNY International Office
            </h2>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
              Role: Founder, Lead Content Producer &amp; Editorial Manager (~80% Core Creation &amp; Final Approval Authority)
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="https://instagram.com/io.uny"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-neutral-900 bg-neutral-900 px-4 font-mono text-xs text-white transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-700 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-neutral-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-1 dark:border-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-neutral-300"
        >
          <span>Open Instagram profile</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Narrative -->
      <div class="mt-4 border-t border-neutral-100 pt-4 dark:border-neutral-800">
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
          Under my formal Student Employment mandate at Universitas Negeri Yogyakarta’s International Office, I founded, branded, and managed the official Instagram channel <strong>@io.uny</strong> from scratch. Over five consecutive years (2021–2026), I served as the primary creator and managerial anchor—personally producing ~80% of all published assets, directing visual strategy, and holding final editorial approval over all peer contributions. Supported by collaborative student teammates, we built the channel from zero into the university’s primary international communications hub with over <strong>8,000 organic followers</strong>, without any paid advertising or marketing agency retainer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Metrics Grid -->
      <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/50 p-3 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Total Audience</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">8,000+ Followers</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">100% Organic Growth</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/50 p-3 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Growth Baseline</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">0 → 8,000+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Founded from scratch</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/50 p-3 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Core Demographic</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">81% Aged 18–34</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">47.2% 18–24 · 33.8% 25–34</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/50 p-3 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Audience Balance</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">54.4% M / 45.6% F</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Balanced global gender split</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Folio Evidence Card -->
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50/60 p-4 dark:border-neutral-700/80 dark:bg-neutral-900/60">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
              Verified Documentation &amp; Analytics Folio
            </p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
              Visual documentation tracking historical follower growth, engagement spikes, and audience demographic breakdown across 2021–2026.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/docs/operations/digital-communications-and-pr.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-neutral-300 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-neutral-800 shadow-2xs hover:bg-neutral-50 dark:border-neutral-600 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 dark:hover:bg-neutral-700"
          >
            <span>View 3-Page Analytics Folio (PDF)</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Detailed Operational Pillars -->
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 text-xs">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/40 p-4 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-sm">Visual Production &amp; Content Architecture</h3>
          <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Designed multi-slide carousel guides explaining complex Indonesian visa regulations, E-Visa extensions, and ITAS biometrics.</li>
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Built promotional campaign assets for university scholarships (Darmasiswa, KNB, UNY International Degree Scholarships).</li>
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Managed stage photo broadcasts and live event coverage for international festivals (GCF) and diplomatic forums (GLOSHIP).</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-200/80 bg-neutral-50/40 p-4 dark:border-neutral-700/60 dark:bg-neutral-800/40">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-sm">Front-Line Helpdesk &amp; Global Inquiries</h3>
          <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Acted as the primary point of contact handling daily Direct Messages and comments from prospective international applicants worldwide.</li>
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Triaged high-priority admission inquiries, tuition eligibility questions, and accommodation guidance in English and Indonesian.</li>
            <li><span class="font-mono text-neutral-400">▸</span> Top geographic follower bases established across Indonesia, Pakistan, Egypt, Yemen, Malaysia, Nigeria, and Timor-Leste.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Proof Links -->
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-neutral-100 pt-4 dark:border-neutral-800 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <a
            href="/docs/operations/digital-communications-and-pr.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-neutral-700 shadow-2xs hover:border-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-900 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 dark:hover:border-neutral-500"
          >
            <span>Analytics Folio (PDF)</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="/international/io-operations"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-neutral-700 shadow-2xs hover:border-neutral-400 hover:text-neutral-900 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 dark:hover:border-neutral-500"
          >
            <span>Operations Dossier</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <span class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-500">Verified by institutional operational records</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Additional Channels Expansion Card -->
    <section class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-50/50 p-5 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-800/20">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-neutral-200 bg-white dark:border-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-800">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/>
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Additional Managed Accounts</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
            Social media platforms, content production channels, and broadcast portals curated across other student organizations (HIMA, Restek, KMHE team, BEM) and community initiatives are being compiled and will be indexed here.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
